<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document" style="font-size:298%;">SABlock: Semantic-Aware KV Cache Eviction with Adaptive Compression Block Size</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Jinhan Chen, Jianchun Liu, Hongli Xu, Xianjun Gao, Shilong Wang
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
